y.\"","consequence":"The lack of an image in the back-up camera display increases the risk of a crash.","remedy":"Nissan will notify owners in phases, having dealers update the back-up camera settings software, free of charge.  The recall began November 11, 2019 and all affected VINs should be activated.  Owners may contact Nissan customer service at 1-800-867-7669 or INFINITI customer service at 1-800-662-6200.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":1228830,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=19V654000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":46,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2018","make":"INFINITI","model":"Q60"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"MAXIMA"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"TITAN"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"SENTRA"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"NV200"},{"year":"2018","make":"INFINITI","model":"QX80"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"MURANO"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"MAXIMA"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"TITAN"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"GT-R"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"PATHFINDER"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"NV"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE SPORT"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE SPORT"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"SENTRA"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"VERSA NOTE"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"VERSA"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"VERSA NOTE"},{"year":"2019","make":"INFINITI","model":"QX50"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"LEAF"},{"year":"2019","make":"INFINITI","model":"QX60"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"KICKS"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":true},{"campaign":"21V839000","received":"2021-10-26","manufacturer":"Nissan North America, Inc.","component":"ENGINE AND ENGINE COOLING:ENGINE:ENGINE CONTROL MODULE (ECU/ECM)","summary":"Nissan North America, Inc. (Nissan) is recalling certain 2017-2019 Rogue Hybrid vehicles.  Contact with the Electronic Control Module (ECM) bracket may damage the engine harness, causing a blown fuse.","consequence":"A blown fuse may cause an engine stall, increasing the risk of a crash.","remedy":"Dealers will install a harness protector cover, free of charge.  Owner notification letters were mailed December 16, 2021.  Owners may contact Nissan customer service at 1-800-867-7669.  Nissan's number for this recall is R21B6.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":5905,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=21V839000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":3,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2017","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"23V093000","received":"2023-02-16","manufacturer":"Nissan North America, Inc.","component":"ELECTRICAL SYSTEM:IGNITION:ANTI-THEFT:IMMOBILIZER/PROXIMITY:KEY/SENDER","summary":"Nissan North America, Inc. (Nissan) is recalling certain 2014-2020 Rogue and 2017-2022 Rogue Sport vehicles equipped with a jackknife style ignition key.  The jackknife key may collapse into a folded position while driving.","consequence":"Driver contact with a key in the collapsed position could inadvertently shut off the vehicle while driving, increasing the risk of a crash.  Additionally, if the vehicle shuts off while driving, the air bags may not deploy in a crash as intended, increasing the risk of injury.","remedy":"Dealers will insert a spacer into the key slot of the jackknife key, free of charge.  Interim notification letters notifying owners of the safety risk were mailed March 29, 2023.  Owner notification letters are expected to be mailed August 30, 2023.  Owners may contact Nissan's customer service at 1-800-867-7669.  Nissan's number for this recall is R22C5.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":712458,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=23V093000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":13,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2020","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2016","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2014","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2017","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2015","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE"},{"year":"2020","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE SPORT"},{"year":"2018","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE SPORT"},{"year":"2019","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE SPORT"},{"year":"2021","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE SPORT"},{"year":"2022","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE SPORT"},{"year":"2017","make":"NISSAN","model":"ROGUE SPORT"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false}]}
